d Length : 1.8 m (5.9 ft) Main Unit Weight : 300 Gram Main Unit Size : 10 cm x 15.5 cm x 2.5 cm (h x w x d) Batteries : 2 AA Alkaline Mini-USB Connection : Interface to Acquisition Computer and Optional Battery Pack (either/or) 7. Safety Leakage Current : <10 µA with 240 VAC on all electrode inputs 8. Operating Parameters Operating Environmental Limits : Temperature: 5°C to 40° Humidity: 15% to 93%; Atmospheric Pressure: 700 hPa to1060 hPa Transport and Storage Temperature Range : - 40°C to 70°C Transport and Storage Humidity Range : 10% to 100%, Including condensation Transport and Storage Atmospheric : 500 hPa to 1060hPa Pressure Range 9. Wireless Tranceiver – BT121 Protocol : Bluetooth 4.2 BR/EDR Operating Frequency : 2.402 – 2.480 GHz Transmission Power : +12dBm FCCID : QOQBT121', 0, 'low', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 348528);
